  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tanggol Katutubo sa Lupaing Ninuno (Defend Indigenous Peoples in their Ancestral Domain)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;overall objective &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;of the Action is to enhance the capacities of Dumagat-Remontado people in nurturing and protecting the natural resources and biodiversity in their ancestral domain. The &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;specific objective &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;is to strengthen capacities of the Dumagat-Remontado Indigenous people as environmental human rights defenders to collectively work with civil society organizations (CSOs) in defending their social and economic human rights in their ancestral domain.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
